[{"text":"FCPartialD[ind] denotes a partial derivative of a field. It is an internal object that may appear only inside a QuantumField.","anchor":"fcpartiald"},{"text":"FCPartialD[LorentzIndex[mu]] denotes \\partial_{\\mu }.","anchor":"fcpartiald"},{"text":"FCPartialD[LorentzIndex[mu ,D]] denotes the D-dimensional \\partial_{\\mu }.","anchor":"fcpartiald"},{"text":"FCPartialD[CartesianIndex[i]] denotes \\partial^{i} = - \\nabla^i.","anchor":"fcpartiald"},{"text":"If you need to specify a derivative with respect to a particular variable it also possible to use FCPartialD[{LorentzIndex[mu],y}] or FCPartialD[{CartesianIndex[i],x}]although this notation is still somewhat experimental","anchor":"fcpartiald"},{"text":"Overview, ExpandPartialD, LeftPartialD, LeftRightPartialD, RightPartialD.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"QuantumField[A, {\\[Mu]}] . LeftPartialD[\\[Nu]] ex = ExpandPartialD[%]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[A_{\\mu }.\\overleftarrow{\\partial }_{\\nu }\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\partial _{\\nu }A_{\\mu }\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*QuantumField[FCPartialD[LorentzIndex[\\[Nu]]], A, LorentzIndex[\\[Mu]]]*)","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"RightPartialD[{CartesianIndex[i], x}] . QuantumField[S, x] ex = ExpandPartialD[%]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\vec{\\partial }_{\\{i,x\\}}.S^x\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\partial _{\\{i,x\\}}S^x\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"ex // StandardForm (*QuantumField[FCPartialD[{CartesianIndex[i], x}], S, x]*)","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCPartialD also accepts FCGV symbols as arguments, which can be sometimes useful to make the final expression look nicer.","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"QuantumField[FCPartialD[FCGV[\"\\[Del]\"]], S, x]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left(\\nabla S^x\\right)\\]","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"}]